@ui_element_interaction@catalog_and_search@fr_002Feature: Product Catalog & Search  Enable customers to browse the product catalog and search by keyword, with filtering by category, price range, brand, and rating, backed by an Elasticsearch index.  Background:    Given the product catalog is available and indexed  Scenario: Filter products by category and price range    Given I am on the product catalog page    When I apply the "Footwear" category filter    And I apply a price range filter from "$50" to "$100"    Then the product list should display only "Footwear" items priced between "$50" and "$100" without a full page reload